'''Football Club Mondercange''' is a [[football (soccer)|football]] [[football club|club]], based in [[Mondercange]], in south-western [[Luxembourg]].

In the 2005–06 season, Mondercange finished third in the [[Luxembourg Division of Honour|Division of Honour]]. This qualified Mondercange for a play-off with [[FC Avenir Beggen]], which they won, granting them promotion into the [[Luxembourg National Division|National Division]].  They were relegated [[Luxembourg National Division 2006-07|the following season]] from the National Division, back to the Division of Honour. In 2008–09 the club finished 2nd in the Division of Honour and were promoted to the [[Luxembourg National Division|National Division]]."}}
